  "description": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"854eb82b-9ce7-48a1-a6dc-b5987dc328fc\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"406\"><strong data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"70\">LEGO DC Super-Villains</strong> is een humorvolle en actievolle <strong data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"150\">action-adventure game voor de PlayStation 4</strong>, waarin je niet de helden maar juist de <strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"203\">schurken</strong> van het DC-universum bestuurt. In de kenmerkende LEGO-stijl beleef je een origineel verhaal vol puzzels, gevechten en grappige momenten. Ideaal voor zowel jongere spelers als volwassen LEGO- en DC-fans.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"423\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"423\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"679\">\r\n<li data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"481\">🦹‍♂️ Uniek verhaal waarin DC-schurken centraal staan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"545\">🎮 Toegankelijke gameplay gecombineerd met actie en puzzels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"588\">\r\n<p data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"588\">😂 Veel humor en herkenbare LEGO-stijl</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"637\">\r\n<p data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"637\">👥 Geschikt voor solo spelen en lokale co-op</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"679\">\r\n<p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"679\">🌍 Groot DC-universum om te verkennen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"787\"><strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"690\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"693\">In Nette Staat<br data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\">De game verkeert in een verzorgde gebruikte staat en is volledig functioneel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"809\">📋 <strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"809\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"973\">\r\n<li data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n<p data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"837\">Platform: PlayStation 4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<p data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"877\">Genre: Action-adventure / LEGO game</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"920\">Spelmodus: Singleplayer & lokale co-op</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"947\">Uitvoering: Met doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"973\">\r\n<p data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"973\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"990\"><strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"990\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<li data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1037\">PlayStation 4 game: LEGO DC Super-Villains</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1058\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1113\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1078\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1081\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-light my-2 flex gap-10 border-t pt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden h-12 w-12 rounded-lg\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">